<title>NORWAY: Leif Hoegh H1 net profits fall.</title>
<headline>Leif Hoegh H1 net profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>				   (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net freight revenues		     1,681    vs     1,739</p>
<p> Operating result before depreciations  393    vs	 345</p>
<p> Ordinary depreciations		    -104    vs	-153</p>
<p> Operating result			     289    vs	 192</p>
<p> Net financial items			 -226    vs	 +31</p>
<p> Result before tax			    160    vs	 261</p>
<p> Net result				     156    vs	 189</p>
<p> EPS (crowns)				  5.20    vs	6.30</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian shipping company is Leif Hoegh &amp; Co. ASA.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
